# Debugging Main App

- [ ] Run `appSamsungGallery.exe` and capture stdout/stderr.
- [ ] Inspect [application.log](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/application.log) and [logs/crash.log](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/logs/crash.log).
- [ ] Identify root cause of failure (crash, missing files, etc.).
- [ ] Implement fixes to ensure the app runs.
- [ ] Verify fix by running the app again.
